## about:blocked: a page the ad blocker's lists block as a whole

blocked-page-title = Page blocked
blocked-page-heading = This page was blocked
# $host (String) - the site that was blocked, e.g. "ads.example.com"
blocked-page-text = { -brand-short-name } stopped { $host } from opening. It’s on EasyList’s list of scam, pop-up and pop-under pages, which often open by themselves from other sites.
blocked-page-back = Go back
blocked-page-continue = Open it anyway
blocked-page-note = Opening it anyway allows this site until you quit { -brand-short-name }. To stop blocking it for good, turn off protections for it with the shield in the address bar.
